 1487   // Description: Verifies that #UNPACK with a JSON MAPFILE:                                             000426   10/18/26
 1488   //              1. Routes *FILE (PF/LF) to PKGTSTDTA and *PGM/*SRVPGM to                               000427   10/18/26
 1489   //                 PKGTSTPGM                                                                           000428   10/18/26
 1490   //              2. Preserves private authorities granted on existing objects                           000429   10/18/26
 1491   //              3. Preserves existing customer rows in TSTCUSTPF                                       000430   10/18/26
 1492   //                 (preserveData: true)                                                                000431   10/18/26
